      "flags": {},
      "order": 5,
      "mode": 0,
      "showAdvanced": null,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MOSS-Image SFT · LITE\n\nEnter Main Prompt, choose size in Resolution, then Queue. The starting size is 1024×1024. Resolution controls dimensions and batch using Flux2/MOSS 128ch /16.\n\nSelect compatible SFT INT8, Qwen3.5 9B INT8 (type=moss_image) and flux2-vae files. Starting recipe: 50 steps, CFG 3, Euler / sgm_uniform, Shift 5, layer-22 unconditional skip. This is not a distilled recipe. Clear single_layers to disable SLG.\n\nhttps://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/comfyui/README.md\n\n### Checked recipe\nMOSS SFT: 50 steps, CFG 3, euler / sgm_uniform. Sampler profile checks model and latent compatibility. Profiles do not select weights: Base, Turbo, Distilled and Edit checkpoints are not interchangeable. Use a fixed seed when comparing changes; increase size only after the prompt and composition work. Shift 5 comes from the model; unconditional skip layer 22 remains connected."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# MOSS-Image SFT · LITE\n\nEnter Main Prompt, choose size in Resolution, then Queue. The starting size is 1024×1024. Resolution controls dimensions and batch using Flux2/MOSS 128ch /16.\n\nSelect compatible SFT INT8, Qwen3.5 9B INT8 (type=moss_image) and flux2-vae files. Starting recipe: 50 steps, CFG 3, Euler / sgm_uniform, Shift 5, layer-22 unconditional skip. This is not a distilled recipe. Clear single_layers to disable SLG.\n\nhttps://github.com/OpenMOSS/MOSS-Image/blob/main/comfyui/README.md\n\n### Checked recipe\nMOSS SFT: 50 steps, CFG 3, euler / sgm_uniform. Sampler profile checks model and latent compatibility. Profiles do not select weights: Base, Turbo, Distilled and Edit checkpoints are not interchangeable. Use a fixed seed when comparing changes; increase size only after the prompt and composition work. Shift 5 comes from the model; unconditional skip layer 22 remains connected."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
